  "label": "User projected onto the protestor as the 'big boy' being infantilized",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the man in the image, who is portrayed as the 'big boy' being fed and praised by the maternal figure. The text 'i protested trump today mommy' and 'ooOOOh, who's my big boy' creates an implicit deictic where the user identifies with the protestor, positioning themselves as the 'big boy' whose political action is being infantilized and cared for by a maternal figure. This projection is reinforced by the visual scene of nurturing care and the ironic textual framing.",
